2630       data a (drop=i);
2631       do i=1 to 1000;
2632       x1=rannor(1234);
2633       x2=rannor(1234);
2634       e=rannor(1234);
2635       if i > 950 then y=100 + 10*e;
2636       else y=10 + 5*x1 + 3*x2 + 0.5 * e;
2637       output;
2638       end;
2639       run;

NOTE: The data set WORK.A has 1000 observations and 4 variables.

2640       proc quantreg data=a;
2641       model y = x1 x2 / seed=314159;
2642       run;

NOTE: No valid quantiles are specified. PROC QUANTREG computes median regression.
NOTE: The PROCEDURE QUANTREG printed page 144.

2643       proc quantreg algorithm=interior(tolerance=1e-6)
2644       ci=none data=a;
2645       model y = x1 x2 / itprint nosummary seed=314159;
2646       run;

NOTE: No valid quantiles are specified. PROC QUANTREG computes median regression.
NOTE: The PROCEDURE QUANTREG printed pages 145-146.

2647       proc quantreg algorithm=smooth(rratio=.5) ci=none data=a;
2648       model y = x1 x2 / itprint nosummary seed=314159;
2649       run;

NOTE: No valid quantiles are specified. PROC QUANTREG computes median regression.
NOTE: The PROCEDURE QUANTREG printed pages 147-148.

